  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_POTATOES_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",          "{1_CityName}人懂得用发芽的马铃薯酿制烈酒，以此驱散高原的严寒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_POTATOES_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",       "{1_CityName}伏特加酒厂出产的“火块茎”烈酒，以其纯净热烈闻名于我国。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_POTATOES_CROPS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}的农家地窖里堆满了马铃薯，这是他们过冬的底气。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_POTATOES_CROPS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "速冻薯条和土豆泥粉从{1_CityName}的工厂产出，改变了我国快节奏的饮食习惯。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_CAPYBARAS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                  "{1_CityName}的沼泽和河流边，生活着世界上最大的啮齿动物——性情温和的水豚。"),
