  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                     "在{1_CityName}的高原上，成群的大羊驼驮着行囊，用清澈的眼神审视路人。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                  "大羊驼形象可爱，在我国有着重要的文化地位，{1_CityName}的文化集团纷纷推出以大羊驼为原型的角色。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_CLOTH_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}妇女用大羊驼毛纺出保暖性极强的毛线，织成蓬松厚实的斗篷。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_CLOTH_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}羊驼绒大衣以其轻暖顺滑，成为我国顶级奢侈大衣的面料来源。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_TRANSIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}的商队驾驭着大羊驼，在陡峭的山路上如履平地，人驼相依。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_LLAMAS_TRANSIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}大羊驼作为生态友好的驮畜，被我国山区科考队与自然保护区广泛使用。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                     "藜麦在{1_CityName}高原的风中摇曳，传说这是神的食粮。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_CORPORATION_TEXT",                  "高档食品超市在{1_CityName}签订订单农业，将藜麦包装成健康谷物推向世界。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_CROPS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的农民用藜麦煮粥、做饼，这种全营养谷物支撑着高原生命。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_CROPS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}藜麦沙拉和谷物碗，被我国健身和素食人群视为能量基石。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_SEASONING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",          "{1_CityName}的厨师把藜麦磨成粉，混入香料制成特制的调味酱，沾肉极佳。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_QUINOA_SEASONING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",       "{1_CityName}藜麦酱油和膨化藜麦粒，以其独特口感丰富了我国的零食调味市场。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                  "{1_CityName}人传颂着女神赠予的马黛茶，这种绿意盎然的叶子是友谊的纽带。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_CORPORATION_TEXT",               "马黛茶企业将切碎的叶片包装成袋，让这种传统饮料走出家乡{1_CityName}。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_BEVERAGE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",        "{1_CityName}的公共场合，人们围坐一圈，共用一根吸管饮用葫芦里的马黛茶。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_BEVERAGE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",     "{1_CityName}马黛茶能量饮，以其天然的咖啡因和抗氧化特性风靡我国健身房。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_CELEBRATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",     "分享马黛茶是{1_CityName}最重要待客礼节，有朋自远方来，必先奉上一杯热茶。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEU_P0K_YERBAMATE_CELEBRATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",  "{1_CityName}出品的鎏金马黛茶具套装，作为国礼赠予我国的贵宾。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}的渔民用灯光诱捕夜间上浮的鱿鱼，海面上恍若繁星点点。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "水产企业为{1_CityName}的船队配备了远洋拖网，鱿鱼捕捞量大幅提升。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}的厨师能把鱿鱼切成精致的麦穗花刀，爆炒后脆嫩无比。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}海鲜主题餐厅以秘制鱿鱼圈作为招牌，食客需提前一周预约。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}码头边的摊位，总是能见到串起来晾晒的鱿鱼干，咸鲜可口。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SQUID_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的冷冻鱿鱼出口至我国各地，成为街头铁板烧的人气食材。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}的冰冷海滨是海豹的乐园，当地原住民依赖它们获得食物与毛皮。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "海洋生物研究所在{1_CityName}保护海豹种群，并且为生物资源的合理开发制定计划。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}渔猎队乘独木舟捕获海豹，每一样部位都不会被浪费，这是极地生存法则。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",      "{1_CityName}出产的优质海豹油富含Omega-3，是我国保健市场上的抢手货。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_SEA_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}的海湾中，驯养的海豹顶球拍鳍，给岸上的游客带来无尽欢笑。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SEALS_SEA_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}海洋保护区的海豹明星，通过电视信号进入了我国的千家万户。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}清透的浅海底，枝枝丫丫的珊瑚礁构成了繁华的水下城市。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "我国海洋研究所正在持续记录{1_CityName}珊瑚礁的存活情况。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}先民用珊瑚礁石烧制白石灰，建成独特的纯白色城堡。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}珊瑚石灰石具有极佳的隔音保温效果，是我国生态建筑师的理想选择。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}的船只将雪白的珊瑚礁石打捞上岸，作为珍贵的土壤改良剂与工艺品原料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CORAL_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",      "{1_CityName}保护活体珊瑚礁，而古珊瑚礁化石则是我国水族馆的景观基石。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                        "{1_CityName}海岸的礁石下躲藏着威风凛凛的大龙虾，虾钳硕大有力。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_CORPORATION_TEXT",                     "捕捞龙虾的帆船在{1_CityName}的港口络绎不绝，为数万名渔民提供岗位。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}的名厨用黄油煎烤龙虾，淋上特制酱汁，是一道著名的压轴菜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}“红龙”龙虾主题汉堡，因其奢华的用料在我国网红店排起长队。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}清晨刚出水的龙虾，直接扔进锅里清蒸，肉质紧实弹牙。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_LOBSTER_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}冷冻龙虾尾为我国的内陆超市带来了平价的海鲜盛宴。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                           "赤魟如隐形的毯子掠过{1_CityName}近海平坦的沙质海底，只留一双突出的眼睛。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                        "干制的{1_CityName}赤魟鳍和皮早已是我国名贵菜肴不可分割的一部分。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}街头铁板上，赤魟肉在酱汁里煎得滋滋作响，配啤酒一绝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}赤魟肉饼因为独特的风味，成为我国飞行旅客的猎奇小吃。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}渔民将赤魟的裙边干制，泡发后极富胶质，口感滑嫩。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_RAYS_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}赤魟翅干是我国佛跳墙等名菜里的重要食材，软糯鲜香。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                        "激流长年冲刷{1_CityName}的礁石，这里紧紧吸附着珍贵的单壳贝——鲍鱼。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                     "我国水产科学家锐意进取，终于在{1_CityName}海域实现了鲍鱼人工养殖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",       "{1_CityName}的采鲍人在悬崖下屏气作业，只有经验最丰富者能采到掌心大的鲍鱼。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",    "{1_CityName}淡干鲍鱼是我国宴请贵客的标志，溏心的口感令人难忘。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}老人常年用鲍鱼壳研磨成粉作为清肝明目的中药，名为石决明。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_ABALONE_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}鲍鱼提取液被证明有极佳的免疫力增强效果，被保健品界看重。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                         "{1_CityName}的河道是鲟鱼洄游产卵之地，黑亮的鱼籽是自然的珍宝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_CORPORATION_TEXT",                      "{1_CityName}养殖基地用点击刺激鲟鱼排卵，让鱼子酱稳定生产。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的鱼子酱颗粒饱满，入口后在舌尖轻轻爆破，释放出海洋的鲜味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}鲟鱼子酱听装出口，被誉为我国餐桌上的“黑黄金”。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_SEASONING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的厨师大胆地将鱼子酱用作调味，即使是配烤土豆也能化平凡为神奇。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_CAVIAR_SEASONING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}鱼子酱调味酱和粉料，让我国的普通家庭也能尝到奢华的味道。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "{1_CityName}的大地之下是绵延数里的花岗岩基岩，坚不可摧。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "重型工程机械开进{1_CityName}的采石场，将整块花岗岩切割成完美的建筑材料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_ART_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "雕塑家被{1_CityName}花岗岩的细腻颗粒所吸引，在此设立工作室精雕细琢。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_ART_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "从{1_CityName}运出的花岗岩雕塑，成为点缀我国城市广场的瑰丽艺术品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的石匠对花岗岩的性质了如指掌，能用它建造永恒矗立的纪念碑。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GRANITE_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}花岗岩奠定了我国无数摩天大厦和跨海大桥的根基。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}的深山采出的青金石如夜空般深蓝，洒落着金色的黄铁矿斑点。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "{1_CityName}的青金石矿山向颜料与珠宝业供应着这种古老的圣石。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_ART_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                         "{1_CityName}画坊将青金石研磨成极珍贵的群青颜料，只用于描摹圣母的衣袍。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_ART_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}出产的“永恒群青”颜料，至今仍是我国艺术家修复古典油画的指定之选。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_DECORATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}贵族用青金石制作印章和项链，相信它能抵御邪祟。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LAPIS_DECORATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}青金石耳环以深邃蓝色点缀了我国的优雅晚宴。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEAD_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}山脉中发现了闪耀着金属光泽的铅锌矿脉，引来探矿者扎根。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LEAD_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "选矿与冶炼基地在{1_CityName}成立，将铅、锌分离，供应工业原料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEAD_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}的药师利用铅丹和炉甘石，调制成消炎收敛的古老药膏。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEAD_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "制药公司以{1_CityName}产出的高纯度氧化锌为原料，生产出我国家家户户营养口服液。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEAD_METALLURGY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的熔炉将铅锌矿石化作银白的锌块与沉重的铅锭。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LEAD_METALLURGY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}锌业公司生产的镀锌钢板，有效抵御了我国的钢铁锈蚀之灾。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                           "{1_CityName}冲积层中混杂着一种沉重的银白色金属，曾被人视为未成熟的黄金丢弃。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_CORPORATION_TEXT",                        "现代工业认识到铂族金属的价值之后，在{1_CityName}建立了复杂的提炼工厂。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_CHEMISTRY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的实验室发现铂是绝佳的催化剂，能加速奇妙的化学反应。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_CHEMISTRY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}铂网和催化转换器，在我国的化工厂与汽车排气系统中默默奉献。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_DECORATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}工匠用铂金打造镶座，因其不褪色且坚韧，能牢固地托住钻石。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PLATINUM_DECORATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}铂金婚戒与项链以纯净的白色光泽，成为我国永恒爱情的象征。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}大地上遍布着晶莹剔透的水晶簇，有些巨大如人。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "成吨的矿石石英保障着{1_CityName}建筑与高科技产业正常运转。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_CHEMISTRY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}压电石英切片被用作精密振荡器，稳定着无线电波。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_CHEMISTRY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}高纯石英坩埚拉出了我国绝大部分的单晶硅，驱动数字时代。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}人将石英砂熔制成坚固的玻璃，镶嵌在宏伟的窗户和温室上。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_QUARTZ_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}优质石英砂是我国摩天楼玻璃幕墙的原产地。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_RUBY_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}的红色刚玉在溪流中如鲜血般醒目，国王将其据为己有。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_RUBY_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "宝石开采公司在{1_CityName}利用现代地质手段寻找红宝石矿囊。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBY_DECORATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的红宝石首饰是王室婚礼的标配，其浓烈的红色被认为代表爱与力量。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBY_DECORATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}鸽血红宝石在我国拍卖行频频刷新克拉单价纪录。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBY_METALLURGY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}出产的红宝石因异常坚硬，被用作精密钟表里的耐磨轴承。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBY_METALLURGY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}人造红宝石晶体，为我国的激光器和精密机械提供了核心元件。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                         "{1_CityName}古朴的寺庙周围种植着珍贵的檀香树，历经数十年沉淀出悠远的香气。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_CORPORATION_TEXT",                      "檀香木种植园与精油蒸馏厂成为{1_CityName}产业的支柱。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_CELEBRATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}的大典上，点燃的檀香木屑让空气里弥漫着神圣与庄严。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_CELEBRATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}特制檀香线香和塔香，是我国冥想、禅修和重大典礼的指定用香。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_HOUSEHOLD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的木匠用檀香木制作梳妆盒与折扇，开合之间，香风习习。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SANDALWOOD_HOUSEHOLD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}檀香木家具与摆件，以其宁神功效，装点了我国的高雅书房。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_OAK_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                                "{1_CityName}的古老橡树林曾被视为神灵居所，如今伐木工敬畏地采伐。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_OAK_CORPORATION_TEXT",                             "大型林业公司接手林地，确保{1_CityName}的橡木既得到利用又得以存续。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OAK_FUEL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                          "{1_CityName}的烧炭人堆起橡木窑，闷烧出火力持久的优质木炭。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OAK_FUEL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                       "“{1_CityName}”牌木炭，让我国的烧烤聚会总是充满浓郁的森林芳香。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OAK_HOUSEHOLD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}的木匠用橡木打造出厚重结实的家具，可以历经数代而不朽。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OAK_HOUSEHOLD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}橡木地板以其古朴的纹理，铺满了我国无数精致住宅。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "古老的{1_CityName}城外村口矗立着枝叶参天的榉树，被视为中举成材的吉祥之木。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "苗木企业在{1_CityName}推广榉树种植，兼顾绿化与木材储备。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的造船厂发现榉木耐水泡、韧性好，是打造龙骨和桨柄的上等材。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}榉木楼梯与地板，纹理秀美硬度高，铺就了我国无数温馨家装。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_ORNAMENTAL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的行道树选用榉树，秋日变作一片金黄与赭红，美不胜收。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MAPLE_ORNAMENTAL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}榉树盆景与景观树，为我国的城市园林提供了优良的彩色树种。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}郊外白色的白云石矿层一旦被削开，便呈现出玉石般的质感。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "矿业集团在{1_CityName}大型白云石采掘场，为建材与工业提供充足原料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}的窑厂烧制白云石变成耐用的砖瓦，修筑家园。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}生产的高级防火砖，保护着我国的炼钢高炉与发电机组。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_METALLURGY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的炼钢工将白云石投入熔炉，它能清除铁水中的杂质。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LIMESTONE_METALLURGY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}白云石使得我国的钢厂效率倍增，成为钢铁熔剂的可靠来源。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALOE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}干旱的土地上，肉质肥厚的芦荟顽强生长，仿佛沙漠绿泉。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALOE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "生物科技公司在{1_CityName}建立芦荟种植与凝胶提取基地。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALOE_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}人将芦荟晶莹的叶肉切丁，与蜂蜜同煮，成为清热的消暑甜品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALOE_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}芦荟果粒酸奶是我国年轻人最爱的健康零食之一。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALOE_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "被烫伤或晒伤时，{1_CityName}人家家户户都会掰一块芦荟涂抹皮肤，瞬间清凉。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALOE_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}芦荟胶面膜和烫伤膏，是我国千家万户药箱里的必备品。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "夏秋之交，{1_CityName}的山坡上缀满了紫红黑蓝的各色浆果，鸟雀与人争食。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "饮料公司在{1_CityName}建立浆果收购点，鼓励农民规模种植。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}人把吃不完的浆果酿成醉人的果酒，染红了杯盏。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}黑莓酒甜蜜微醺，是我国浪漫晚宴上的宠儿。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_FRUIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "清晨采摘的浆果被装在竹篮里，当天就送到{1_CityName}的集市，沾着露水。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BERRIES_FRUIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}浆果合作社的果酱与冷冻浆果，让我国的早餐一年四季都有甜蜜。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "{1_CityName}的原野上，每当春风吹过，殷红的虞美人便如烈火般摇曳。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "园艺公司培育出重瓣复色虞美人品种，使{1_CityName}成为知名花乡。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_ART_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "画家在{1_CityName}的虞美人田边支起画架，试图捕捉流动的红色。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_ART_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "以{1_CityName}虞美人为主题的画作和印花布料，为我国带来了印象派般的色彩。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_ORNAMENTAL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的孩子在虞美人花海中奔跑，这片景色如梦似幻，令人心醉。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POPPIES_ORNAMENTAL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}虞美人切花在我国的婚礼和纪念仪式上象征深情与缅怀。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}冷冽的山泉溪流中，虹鳟鱼如水中彩虹，机敏地躲避着垂钓者。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "冷水鱼养殖场利用{1_CityName}的优质水源，推广虹鳟网箱与流水养殖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}的熏鱼师傅用果木将虹鳟熏制成金红色，油润咸香。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}即食虹鳟条，作为我国户外运动者补充蛋白的美味零食，大受欢迎。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "刚钓上来的{1_CityName}虹鳟，直接上火烤制，撒上粗盐就是人间美味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CAVIAR_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}虹鳟生鱼片在我国内陆日料店作为三文鱼亲民替代品，日渐流行。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SALMON_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}湍急清冷的溪流中，成群的三文鱼逆流而上，完成生命轮回。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SALMON_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "三文鱼养殖网箱在{1_CityName}的峡湾铺开，无微不至地管理着这种美味的鱼类。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SALMON_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}的烟熏三文鱼作坊用松枝慢火熏制，赋予鱼肉橡木般的风味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SALMON_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}烟熏三文鱼三明治，风靡我国的健康轻食圈和早午餐餐桌。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SALMON_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}切出的三文鱼刺身有着完美的大理石油脂纹路，入口即化。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SALMON_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}冰鲜三文鱼每日空运，是我国日料店评级最高的鱼生。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}的冷水海域生长着茂密的巨型海带森林，随波摇曳如同海底龙宫。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "{1_CityName}的浅海有片区域遍布绳索，是我国的海带养殖中心。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}渔民趁低潮收割海带，铺在海滩上晒干，捆扎起来用于煲汤。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",          "{1_CityName}海带结和即食海带丝，是我国食堂和餐厅最便宜的海洋蔬菜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_SEASONING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}煮妇都知道海带上的白霜是天然的味精，丢一片进锅，汤就变鲜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALGAE_SEASONING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "从{1_CityName}海带中提取的谷氨酸钠，开启了我国味精工业的时代。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CORAL_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}幽暗的海底崖壁上，生长着红宝石般的珊瑚树，珍贵且脆弱。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CORAL_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "商业化的珊瑚养殖在{1_CityName}的海滩大获成功，保护环境的同时也促进了海洋开发。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CORAL_DECORATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}工匠将红珊瑚圆珠与绿松石、黄金串在一起，制作出华贵的项链。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CORAL_DECORATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}沙丁红珊瑚饰品，是我国新生儿与新娘收到的最传统祝福。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CORAL_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}的深海红珊瑚经过打磨后，呈现出温润的玻璃质感，被视为海中瑰宝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CORAL_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",          "{1_CityName}红珊瑚枝摆件，因其稀少，是我国身份和辟邪的象征。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}的浅滩上有着无数花纹精致的小贝壳，人们用它们进行以物易物。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "工艺品公司与{1_CityName}银行合作，管理着以货贝为原料的特殊纪念币生产。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}的妇女将货贝串成长串，用来交换粮食、盐和布料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",      "{1_CityName}货贝作为文化符号，出现在我国的文创饰品和风铃上。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_MINTING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}的仓储中，成堆的货贝代表着部族的财富，不可随意消耗。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEASHELLS_MINTING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "货贝铸造成为我国金属货币早期形制的灵感源泉，至今可见其影子。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}的山坡的阳面翠竹成海，风过处飒飒作响，取之不尽。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "竹材深加工基地在{1_CityName}落成，让竹子成为钢材和塑料的绿色替代品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_HOUSEHOLD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}人用竹子搭建房屋，制作桌椅凉席，整个城市弥漫着清新的竹香。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_HOUSEHOLD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}竹集成地板和竹制家具，凭借环保坚韧的特性风行我国。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_STATIONERY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}的文人用竹管制成毛笔，在竹浆纸上写诗作画，相得益彰。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BAMBOO_STATIONERY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}竹纤维笔记本和竹制U盘等文创，是我国企业青睐的商务伴手礼。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_EBONY_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "靠近{1_CityName}的河床下沉睡着历经千年碳化而成的乌木，坚硬黝黑，不惧水侵。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_EBONY_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "珍稀木材公司在{1_CityName}以极高成本打捞乌木，用于精雕奢侈品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_EBONY_CELEBRATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}王宫的典礼权杖由整根乌木制成，象征不朽的统治与尊贵的身份。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_EBONY_CELEBRATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}乌木镇纸与念珠，因其刚硬又温润的质感，成为我国收藏界的心头好。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_EBONY_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}神庙的立柱由珍贵的乌木支撑，数百年屹立不倒，通体乌黑发亮。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_EBONY_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}乌木饰面板可用于我国超豪华汽车的仪表台与顶级会所的墙面。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}的果园不仅带来甜美的樱桃，果实采摘后，还有光洁的樱桃木。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "木材加工厂将樱桃木锯解烘干，供应{1_CityName}的高档家居市场。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_CELEBRATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的木匠用樱桃木制作精致的乐器，在丰收庆典上奏出欢快的旋律。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_CELEBRATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}樱桃木小提琴和吉他，以其温暖音色和美丽花纹，获得我国音乐家青睐。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_ORNAMENTAL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}的春天，漫山遍野的樱桃花如粉白云霞，吸引无数人踏青赏花。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAKURA_ORNAMENTAL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}樱桃节庆和樱花文创，是我国春季旅游的热门IP。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                           "严冬的峭壁上，山羊贴身长出一层细密轻柔的绒毛，开春时被{1_CityName}的梳毛工精心梳下。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                        "羊绒品牌在{1_CityName}建立纺织厂，将这种钻石般的纤维转化为奢华纱线。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_CLOTH_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}织就的羊绒围巾轻如鸿毛，却能抵御刺骨的寒风。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_CLOTH_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}“云朵”羊绒衫以极简主义设计，温暖了我国精英阶层的秋冬。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_DECORATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}手艺人将羊绒擀制成柔软的毡帽和胸针，精致而温暖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_CASHMERE_DECORATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}羊绒毡艺术品和配饰，在我国时尚买手店中独树一帜。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_PINE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}的山岭被挺拔的松林覆盖，风吹过送来阵阵松涛。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_PINE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "木材公司在{1_CityName}建立了现代化的伐木场和木材加工复合体。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PINE_FUEL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                         "{1_CityName}人收集松脂和松枝，用来制作火把和助燃的材料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PINE_FUEL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}松油与松木颗粒燃料，成为我国露营爱好者和壁炉用户的绝佳选择。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PINE_STATIONERY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的松木被打成纸浆，造出微微泛黄的纸张，书写十分流畅。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_PINE_STATIONERY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}造纸厂生产的松木纸笔记本，深受我国作家和学生的喜爱。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TIN_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                                "{1_CityName}的河流沉积物中闪烁着黝黑的锡砂，淘锡工终日劳作。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TIN_CORPORATION_TEXT",                             "探明深层矿脉后，{1_CityName}锡矿公司引入冲积采矿船大规模开采。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIN_CHEMISTRY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}的实验室里，锡被用来合成媒染剂，让织物的色彩更加艳丽。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIN_CHEMISTRY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}有机锡化工基地，为我国的塑料与涂料工业提供关键助剂。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIN_METALLURGY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}的工匠将锡熔铸成精美的酒壶与烛台，泛着银光。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIN_METALLURGY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}锡器凭借其无毒抗锈的特性，成为我国高档厨具的代名词。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}雨林中的工人迎着第一缕晨光，在橡胶树上划开斜斜的刀口。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "大型橡胶园在{1_CityName}扩张，为急速增长的交通与工业需求提供原料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_CHEMISTRY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的化学家将橡胶硫化，让它变得坚固而有弹性，用于神奇发明。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_CHEMISTRY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}合成橡胶产业，为我国的车轮、密封件提供了不可或缺的物资。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_HOUSEHOLD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}出产的橡胶被制成柔韧的胶鞋和床垫，提升日常生活品质。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_RUBBER_HOUSEHOLD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}乳胶家居用品凭借舒适防螨的特点，成为我国新中产的首选。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_OXEN_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "在{1_CityName}城郊的水田中，耕牛不紧不慢地劳作，随着农人日入而作日入而息。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_OXEN_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "传统的农耕方式正在被拖拉机和化肥取代，{1_CityName}的牧场主正在为耕牛寻找新的出路。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OXEN_AGRICULTURE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}市政府通过统一给农民提供耕牛来鼓励农业生产。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OXEN_AGRICULTURE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "耕牛在{1_CityName}田园牧歌的农村记忆中永远占据着独特地位。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OXEN_TRANSIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}的城市和乡村直接通过牛车建立了繁忙的运输网络。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_OXEN_TRANSIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "牛车是{1_CityName}源远流长的农耕文化的重要载体。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_HAM_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                                "{1_CityName}的山风吹拂着挂在屋檐下的猪腿，在时光中慢慢发酵成红宝石般的生火腿。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_HAM_CORPORATION_TEXT",                             "肉类食品集团在{1_CityName}建立起控温控湿的火腿窖藏库，规模化生产这一极品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_HAM_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "薄如蝉翼的{1_CityName}火腿切片入口即化，带着橡果和时间的绵长回味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_HAM_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}伊比利亚式火腿，是我国高级酒会和礼品清单上的常胜将军。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_HAM_OIL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                           "{1_CityName}人善于利用火腿修整下来的脂肪，炼出香气扑鼻的火腿油，用来煎炒蔬菜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_HAM_OIL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                        "{1_CityName}火腿油辣酱，将动物油脂的醇厚发挥到极致，是我国拌面神器。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                         "{1_CityName}的温泉沿着悬崖流淌，沉淀出多孔而坚韧的石灰华，如同时间的阶梯。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                      "建材公司可持续地采掘{1_CityName}的石灰华，将其变成奢侈的材料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_CONSTRUCTION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}的古竞技场和浴场大量使用了本地的石灰华，成就了不朽的建筑奇观。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_CONSTRUCTION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",        "{1_CityName}石灰华板材，是我国设计师打造自然主义温泉酒店的首选。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}的温泉石灰华被认为富含矿物质，磨碎后用于调理肠胃。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TRAVERTINE_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}天然钙补充剂采自这里纯净的石灰华，守护我国民众的骨骼健康。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}矿坑中出产微微透光的雪花石膏，如半透明的蜜糖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "工艺石材厂将{1_CityName}的雪花石膏切割成薄片，用于建筑物装饰。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_ART_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}大教堂的窗棂上镶嵌的不是玻璃，而是雪花石膏板，透出温暖圣洁的光。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_ART_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}雪花石膏灯饰温暖了我国万千家庭的起居室。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的老中医用煅烧过的雪花石膏粉末配合其他草药退热定惊。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ALABASTER_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}出品的精制石膏粉，是我国骨折固定和牙模取样的指定材料。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}火山口边缘凝结着硫磺，有着刺鼻的气味，被称作地狱的火焰。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "化工企业在{1_CityName}铺设管道，将熔化的硫磺安全运出山口。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_CHEMISTRY_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的皮肤病药膏以硫磺为主药，能有效杀灭疥虫与真菌。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_CHEMISTRY_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}医药级硫磺软膏，是我国治疗痤疮与脂溢性皮炎的常见药。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}的硫磺是制造火药和硫酸的基础，烟火匠人视其为宝贝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_GOLD2_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}硫化工联合体，为我国的橡胶硫化与化肥工业提供了核心原料。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_COD_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                                "{1_CityName}的渔场冰冷富饶，大西洋鳕鱼群千百年来为人类提供蛋白。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_COD_CORPORATION_TEXT",                             "大型拖网加工船在{1_CityName}作业，将鳕鱼直接在船上处理为冻鱼片。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_COD_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}的渔民从鳕鱼肝脏中仔细刮取淡黄色的油脂，治疗夜盲症。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_COD_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}鳕鱼肝油胶囊是我国一代人成长的记忆，守护骨骼和视力。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_COD_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "{1_CityName}的晒鱼架上晾满了开膛的鳕鱼，在冷风中变成耐储存的鳕鱼干。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_COD_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}北极鳕鱼汉堡排，是我国家庭冰箱里的重要储备粮。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                           "{1_CityName}的近海常能围捕到银背条纹的鲭鱼群，夜晚渔火点点。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_CORPORATION_TEXT",                        "鱼罐头厂与鱼粉加工厂依据{1_CityName}鲭鱼的肥美特性，设计出专门生产线。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}老渔民经常吃肥的鲭鱼，他们认为这能预防冬季的心脏病。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}鲭鱼油提纯的EPA胶囊，是我国调节血脂的明星保健品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}把鲭鱼用醋和盐腌制，做成可以久放的醋鲭鱼，风味独特。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MACKEREL_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}茄汁鲭鱼罐头，是我国应急储备和户外野营的经典口味。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "{1_CityName}海浪拍打的礁石上，密密麻麻附着着黝黑发亮的青口贝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "贝类养殖公司采用浮筏吊养技术，将{1_CityName}的青口贝产量翻了几番。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}烹饪青口贝的方法极其简单，白葡萄酒一浇，焖熟的贝肉鲜甜无比。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}“海洋香吻”青口贝主题餐厅，让食客体验最正宗的海风味道。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",           "趁潮水退去，{1_CityName}的赶海人麻利地将青口贝从礁石上铲入背篓。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSSELS_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",        "{1_CityName}产的速冻青口贝肉，是我国海鲜披萨和西班牙烩饭的必备配料。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}的潜水员在海底礁石上发现柔软多孔的海绵，用力一挤水便会排出。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "海绵加工场将{1_CityName}的天然海绵晾晒修剪，供给卫浴与清洁市场。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_HOUSEHOLD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}人把海绵晒干填充在垫子和枕头里，透气又有弹性。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_HOUSEHOLD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}海绵工业将其做成减震衬垫和隔音材料，服务我国的精密仪器和家装。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",            "{1_CityName}的天然海绵是用来沐浴和清洗伤口的上佳材料，吸水柔软。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SPONGE_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}天然海绵比人造海绵更耐用环保，被我国的推崇可持续生活者追捧。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                         "{1_CityName}的礁石潮间带布满了黑色的长刺海胆，小心翼翼撬开，里面藏着金黄色的宝。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_CORPORATION_TEXT",                      "海胆加工厂在{1_CityName}将新鲜海胆开壳取黄，急速冷冻锁鲜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的厨师将海胆与鸡蛋、奶油混合，蒸出海胆茶碗蒸，滑嫩无比。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}海胆酱以其浓郁的奶油鲜味，成为我国分子料理界的新宠。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_SEAFOOD_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}海胆黄带着淡淡的大海甜味，用勺子挖着吃，是对味蕾的极致犒赏。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SEA_URCHIN_SEAFOOD_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}海胆黄罐头与冷冻板，是我国高档寿司店与私厨的必备库存。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ORCA_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}外的冰冷海域，黑白相间的虎鲸群高高跃起，是海洋顶级的捕食者。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_ORCA_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "极地游艇公司以{1_CityName}为母港，组织观鲸生态游，严格保持距离。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ORCA_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}原住民在传统捕鲸配额下猎取少数虎鲸，其皮脂是珍贵的热量来源。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ORCA_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "虎鲸主题的{1_CityName}极地文化中心，向我国的人们贩卖关于海洋的壮丽想象。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ORCA_SEA_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}海洋世界里的虎鲸表演，因其巨大的体型与灵性，震撼人心。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_ORCA_SEA_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}虎鲸保护研究机构的纪录片，改变了我国公众对鲸豚的认知。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_WOLF_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}的森林中，狼嚎在月夜下此起彼伏，象征着野性与团结。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_WOLF_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "狼群研究与驯养中心在{1_CityName}落成，探讨狼对生态与狩猎的价值。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_WOLF_AGRICULTURE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的猎人将狼驯化为最忠实的狩猎伙伴，协同围捕大型猎物。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_WOLF_AGRICULTURE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "由{1_CityName}繁育的狼犬后代，成为了我国军警和牧羊人最得力的工具。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_WOLF_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                        "{1_CityName}的保护区为狼提供了栖息地，维持着森林生态的平衡。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_WOLF_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}狼群观察站吸引着我国的科学家与摄影爱好者前来记录。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TIGER_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}的密林深处，虎的条纹在灌木丛中时隐时现，令人敬畏。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TIGER_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "大型野生动物保护基金在{1_CityName}设立，借此发展高端观赏与繁育。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIGER_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "{1_CityName}的虎神庙是当地信仰中心，虎被视为森林的守护神。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIGER_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}老虎保护区的生态旅游，成为我国自然探险的高端项目。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIGER_LEATHER_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "猎虎曾是{1_CityName}勇士的证明，虎皮被制成战袍和权威的宝座垫。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TIGER_LEATHER_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "由于禁猎，{1_CityName}仅存的古董虎皮在我国的拍卖行已属于禁止交易的传奇。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LION_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                               "{1_CityName}的草原上，雄狮的鬃毛在落日下如同帝王的披风。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_LION_CORPORATION_TEXT",                            "狮子保育与文化交流中心在{1_CityName}成立，管理着与这种百兽之王的接触。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LION_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                        "{1_CityName}的先民以狮为图腾，仿效它的勇猛，雕刻狮像镇守门庭。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LION_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}狮子主题酒店与动物园，让我国的游客体验真正的狂野心跳。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LION_CELEBRATION_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的凯旋仪式上，被驯服的狮子被牵着走在前列，彰显征服。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_LION_CELEBRATION_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}驯狮表演团，曾在我国的大型庆祝活动中呈现马戏艺术的辉煌。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}水草丰美的草原上，雨后一圈圈洁白的口蘑破土而出，牧民争相采摘。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "食用菌企业从{1_CityName}草原的牧民手中收购口蘑，制成罐头与干片。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}人在锅中用白水涮口蘑，一口鲜汤胜过鸡汤。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}草原白蘑酱，因其极致的鲜美，成为我国聘任的佳品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的蒙医认为口蘑有舒筋活血、降低血脂的功效，常作药膳。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MUSHROOMS_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}口蘑多糖胶囊在我国的保健品市场上供不应求。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}云雾缭绕的悬崖峭壁上，采药人系着绳索寻找珍贵的铁皮石斛。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                       "生物医药集团攻克了铁皮石斛人工繁育难关，在{1_CityName}建立规模化种植基地。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}的郎中称铁皮石斛为“仙草”，煎煮后饮用可滋阴清热，延年益寿。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}石斛枫斗和含片，是我国中老年人护嗓润肺的养生上品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_ORNAMENTAL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",              "{1_CityName}的兰苑中，铁皮石斛开出淡雅的黄花，是清雅品格的象征。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_MEDIHERBS_ORNAMENTAL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",           "{1_CityName}石斛兰花盆景，是我国精英阶层书桌与茶席上的新宠。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "在{1_CityName}的热带雨林里，色彩斑斓的小小箭毒蛙在叶间跳跃，土著拿它制作毒镖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "生物科研机构在{1_CityName}模拟雨林环境，养殖箭毒蛙以提取其分泌物。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_BEAST_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}的箭毒蛙展览色彩鲜艳，但游客只能隔着玻璃欣赏它的艳丽。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_BEAST_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}两栖爬行动物馆的箭毒蛙区，是我国家庭科普游的热门打卡地。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}巫医将箭毒蛙的毒液稀释后，用于治疗顽固的神经疼痛。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOXINS_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}箭毒蛙毒素成分被开发为超强止痛药，为我国医疗提供了新武器。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_DATES_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                              "{1_CityName}的绿洲旁，高高的椰枣树垂下串串金黄蜜甜的果实，是沙漠的恩赐。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_DATES_CORPORATION_TEXT",                           "椰枣种植园与包装厂在{1_CityName}成立，将这一甜蜜产物销往全球。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_DATES_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}人将熟透的椰枣发酵，酿出带有焦糖风味的棕榈酒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_DATES_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}椰枣酒以其温润甜蜜，成了我国冬季节庆的热饮之选。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_DATES_FRUIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                       "{1_CityName}的孩童最期待椰枣成熟的季节，饱满的果实是天然的糖果。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_DATES_FRUIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}日晒椰枣干，因其营养丰富且便于携带，成为我国探险家的常备能量棒。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "金秋的{1_CityName}，紫色的藏红花在风中绽放，一缕缕红色花柱是上等的药材。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "香料集团精心组织{1_CityName}藏红花的采摘与烘干，每一克都价值不菲。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_MEDICINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的老医师用藏红花泡水给病人服用，活血解郁，暖身散寒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}藏红花素在我国被开发为抗抑郁和护眼的珍贵保健品。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_ORNAMENTAL_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}人将番红花球茎种在石槽里，花开时满院生辉，幽香阵阵。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SAFFRON_ORNAMENTAL_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}藏红花种球出口，让我国的园艺爱好者也能种出“红色黄金”。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "{1_CityName}的菜园里，红彤彤的番茄挂满枝头，最初只被当作观赏植物。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "食品加工厂在{1_CityName}拔地而起，将新鲜的番茄转化为易于储存的酱料和饮料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_BEVERAGE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}人首先尝试将多汁的番茄榨成鲜红的饮品，加冰后清爽开胃。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_BEVERAGE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}番茄汁“红钻”品牌，作为健康早餐饮品，畅销我国的超市货架。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_FRUIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}集市上的番茄品种繁多，有的酸甜可口，直接当水果食用。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_TOMATO_FRUIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的圣女果温室基地，保障了我国一年四季餐桌上的新鲜点缀。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "在{1_CityName}的空气稀薄的高原，唯有坚韧的青稞能在这片土地上抽穗成熟。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}地方政府大力推动青稞加工产业，力图解决高原农民的生计困境。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}的酿酒作坊用青稞和雪山融水，蒸酿出猛烈而清澈的烧酒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}青稞酒厂出品的“雪山魂”白酒，是我国高度烈酒市场上的新贵。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_CROPS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}的农民把青稞炒熟磨成糌粑，这是他们朝圣和劳作时的能量来源。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_BARLEY_CROPS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}青稞麦片和饼干被送上我国人的早餐桌，带来高原谷物的清香。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_POTATO_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                             "番薯藤蔓疯长，在{1_CityName}的农田地下结出饱满的块根，救荒无数。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_POTATO_CORPORATION_TEXT",                          "{1_CityName}的地方政府大力番薯的加工潜力，生产淀粉、粉条和休闲食品，以提高农民收入。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POTATO_CROPS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                      "{1_CityName}的孩子最期待街角的烤番薯摊，剥开焦皮，滚烫香甜。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POTATO_CROPS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}烤番薯冷冻半成品，让我国的城市人在微波炉里就能重温童年。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POTATO_CUISINE_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                    "{1_CityName}人把番薯磨浆，漏成爽滑的粉条，搭配酸辣汤，是人间至味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_POTATO_CUISINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                 "{1_CityName}番薯干和紫薯仔等零食，凭借天然甜糯，在我国白领间刮起旋风。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                            "红彤彤的高粱穗子在{1_CityName}的旱地中顽强生长，如同燃烧的火把。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_CORPORATION_TEXT",                         "酿酒集团在{1_CityName}建立高粱种植基地，专供名酒生产的原料。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                   "{1_CityName}的酒作坊用大曲发酵高粱，蒸出香气凛冽的中国白酒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}高粱白酒以其窖香浓郁、回味悠长的特点，在我国烈酒比赛中夺魁。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_CROPS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                     "{1_CityName}人把高粱磨碎蒸成红面鱼鱼，蘸着酸辣的汁水，是地道农家味。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SORGHUM_CROPS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}高粱米与饲料加工业，为我国的畜牧业和餐桌提供着坚实后盾。"),

  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_INDUSTRY_TEXT",                         "{1_CityName}的草莓园里，翠绿的叶子下藏着鲜红娇嫩的心形浆果。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_BUILD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_CORPORATION_TEXT",                      "农业合作社在{1_CityName}的乡村普及高架基质栽培，无公害草莓的产量逐年攀升。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_BREWING_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                "{1_CityName}人将过剩的草莓发酵，酿出粉红色、气泡丰富的草莓起泡酒。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_BREWING_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}草莓利口酒是我国年轻女性派对中的最爱，甜蜜醉人。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_FRUIT_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",                  "{1_CityName}的清晨，带着露珠的草莓被摘下，放进垫着软草的小篮中售卖。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_STRAWBERRY_FRUIT_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",               "{1_CityName}草莓采摘节和草莓蛋糕快闪店，是我国春季的浪漫风景线。");